@startuml Composite
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title Composite — Simpler example (C#)

interface IFileSystemNode {
  + Name : string
  + Size : long
}

class File {
  + Name : string
  + Size : long
  + File(name : string, size : long)
}

class Directory {
  - _children : List<IFileSystemNode>
  + Name : string
  + Directory(name : string)
  + Add(child : IFileSystemNode) : Directory
  + Size : long
}

class SolutionDemo {
  + Run() : void
  - Print(n : IFileSystemNode) : void
}

IFileSystemNode <|.. File
IFileSystemNode <|.. Directory

note right of IFileSystemNode : Component
note bottom of File : Leaf
note bottom of Directory : Composite
note bottom of SolutionDemo : Client

Directory o-[norank]-> "*" IFileSystemNode : _children
SolutionDemo .[norank].> IFileSystemNode
@enduml
